    "description": "Seasonal eating in Iran connects fresh ingredients, preserved harvests, regional environments, and culinary ideas about suitable foods for different times of year. Documented traditions in Gilan and the wider history of fruit preservation show why there is no single national seasonal menu.",
    "tags": ["Seasonal cooking", "Fruit preservation", "Gilan", "Regional cuisines", "Food culture"],
